<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 10588 0 R/Alt(Panel (a): two grey conducting plates, one above the other, a distance 2D apart. Two field lines B in blue are anchored on the plates and bowed towards each other, with height l; black arrows labelled f show the external force that stretches them, and the horizontal extent of each arc is D. Panel (b): after reconnection the field lines run straight between the plates, and arrows labelled v show the plasma moving outwards.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[72]/Pg 16330 0 R>>
